      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED / LED_BUILTIN (D17 alias) — onboard general-purpose user LED. Presence confirmed via the official iLabs datasheet (\"pin D15\" in iLabs' own silkscreen numbering) cross-referenced to GPIO19 via CircuitPython's independent board.LED=GPIO19 definition, matching this board's own PIN_LED=(19u). Active-high polarity is a cross-referenced inference from the sibling challenger_2040_wifi board's datasheet (\"Active level: High\" for the identical shared reference LED circuit reused across this iLabs product line) plus every other RP2040 board audited in this family to date being active-high."
